<title>USA: Bristol Technology names Monac VP-CFO.</title>
<headline>Bristol Technology names Monac VP-CFO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bristol Technology Systems Inc said Friday it had named Roger Monaco as senior vice president-chief financial officer.</p>
<p>Prior to joining Bristol, Monaco was vice president and CFO at Access Television Network Inc.</p>
<p>Bristol officials were not available to provide further details.</p>
